Third-party scripts used by den's `pagetools` plugin (Plugins/pagetools). Each is read from
disk and injected into a page (webviews.inject) only when its feature is used.

Readability.js, Readability-readerable.js
  Mozilla Readability, https://github.com/mozilla/readability
  Commit ab4027a8b37669745016869a37a504727992b2ba, unmodified.
  Apache License 2.0, see LICENSE-readability.

fragment-generation.js
  GoogleChromeLabs text-fragments-polyfill, https://github.com/GoogleChromeLabs/text-fragments-polyfill
  src/text-fragment-utils.js and src/fragment-generation-utils.js at commit
  abc6ed408b3f20e91d9cbda9977748459f5e3877, joined into one classic script: the ES module
  import/export statements were replaced by an IIFE that sets window.__denFragments. No other change.
